    'Select an alliance class to receive special bonuses. You can change the alliance class in the alliance menu, provided you have the requisite permissions.' => [
        'en' => 'Select an alliance class to receive special bonuses. You can change the alliance class in the alliance menu, provided you have the requisite permissions.',
